[2026-05-31T14:52:10.089297] [INFO] Node Code Reviewer - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Code Reviewer Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'arxiv_query_tool.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 264291, 'snippet': '"""\r\r\nThis module contains the ArXivQueryTool class for querying the ArXiv database.\r\r\n"""\r\r\n\r\r\nimport requests\r\r\n\r\r\nclass ArXivQueryTool:\r\r\n    def __init__(self, base_url=\'http://export.arxiv.org/api/query?\'):\r\r\n        self.base_url = base_url\r\r\n\r\r\n    def search(self, query, max_results=10):\r\r\n        params = {\'search_query\': query, \'start\': 0, \'max_results\': max_results}\r\r\n        response = requests.get(self.base_url, params=params)\r\r\n        if response.status_code == 200:\r\r\n            return response.text  # Or parse and return structured data\r\r\n        else:\r\r\n            print(f\'Error: Received response code {response.status_code}\')\r\r\n            return None\r\r\n\r\r\n    def print_results(self, results):\r\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 399937, 'modified_ts': 1780231923.30137, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 1075, 'arguments': {'path': 'arxiv_query_tool.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.07550930976867676
