[2026-05-31T14:53:05.300557] [INFO] Node Programmer Code Review - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Programmer Code Review Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'arxiv_query_tool.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 40, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 40, 'total_lines': 528585, 'snippet': '"""\r\r\n\r\r\nThis module contains the ArXivQueryTool class for querying the ArXiv database.\r\r\n\r\r\n    def save_to_csv(self, results, filename):\r\r\n        csv_handler = CSVHandler()\r\r\n        csv_handler.save_to_csv(results, filename)\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\nimport requests\r\r\n    def save_to_csv(self, results, filename):\\n        csv_handler = CSVHandler()\\n        csv_handler.save_to_csv(results, filename)\\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\nclass ArXivQueryTool:\r\r\n\r\r\n    def __init__(self, base_url=\'http://export.arxiv.org/api/query?\'):\r\r\n\r\r\n        self.base_url = base_url\r\r\n\r\r\n', 'truncated': True, 'file_size': 796639, 'modified_ts': 1780231964.8958607, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 891, 'arguments': {'path': 'arxiv_query_tool.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.07014989852905273
